<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Advtech half yr shr surges, no div.</title>
<headline>Advtech half yr shr surges, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr ended August 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Attrib Shr (cts)    7.55	    vs  0.14</p>
<p>    Attrib income	 2.21	    vs  0.03</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		 2.97	    vs  0.03</p>
<p>    Tax		     0.67	    vs  none</p>
<p>    Turnover		29.50	   vs  8.72</p>
<p>Full name: Advanced Technical Systems Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said it was company policy to consider dividends only at the end of the financial year.</p>
<p>They expected earnings for the second half of the year to be maintained at present levels. In the longer-term, the group intended to considerably increase its involvement in education through internal expansion and further acquisitions.</p>
<p>Prospects for the future remained very positive, they said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
